ser_given": false, "identity_details_given": false, "sensitive_data_present": false, "likely_apple_user": false}}], "written": {"pilot0000_0": ["My package from order #58213 arrived late, which I think has to do with switching to a new phone.", "Since switching to my new phone, I was charged $54.20 twice for one order placed last Saturday, so I'd like a refund to get that money back by Friday.", "I'm fed up, my frustration keeps growing, and I'll cancel and shop elsewhere if this isn't fixed.", "Thanks in advance for your help, and have a good day."], "pilot0000_1": ["Hi there, I hope you're doing well.", "Pages load very slowly when opening a folder and scrolling, showing \"Request timed out\", and I think the latest app update broke it for everyone, though the web works.", "With the latest app update, I keep wishing I could export to CSV, which would be nice to have by the end of the month.", "To be honest, it's been kind of a hassle, and I'm not really sure what's going on with it."], "pilot0000_2": ["Paying by credit card for my order placed last Thursday, I see an unexpected fee on the bill and want it back, or I'll dispute it with my bank.", "Since changing my email address, export to CSV still isn't available, which is frustrating, so please add it and reach me at jo.parent@example.com.", "Ever since I changed my email address, I still can't log in on my Mac, even after resetting my password, and there's no other way in.", "Frankly, I'm irritated with how this has gone, but I'm trying to stay patient."], "pilot0000_3": ["I was charged $9.99 through PayPal for order #A3392, so I'd like a refund to get my money back, or I'll dispute it with my bank or card company.", "Opening the activity page and sorting by date shows a suspicious login after the latest app update, though I've signed out everywhere, it's cosmetic, and others see it too.", "Separately, pages load very slowly for me, but I can work around it, and I'd guess lots of people have this as well.", "Could I speak with a real person, such as a manager or supervisor, about these issues?"]}, "cost_usd": 0.051664999999999996, "seconds": 375.3, "thinking_tokens": 101586}